              <td class="p-3 border-r border-hairline font-semibold text-cyan-deep">4 1/4" (Grip Size 2) ⭐</td>
              <td class="p-3 border-r border-hairline text-mute">107.95 mm</td>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-ink">Most popular standard adult size</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline">
              <td class="p-3 border-r border-hairline font-medium text-ink">4.25" – 4.375"</td>
